{"id":"4022973907338479212","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"聖圭應援團真的很懂怎麼讓粉絲幸福！\n\n直接開啟「KYU ON-AIR」線上同樂觀影會！\n\n誰說沒有新演唱會，就不能一起享受舞台？\n\n從聖圭樂團、〈不朽的名曲〉\n到 NELL 翻唱、音樂劇舞台\n一次重溫不同面貌的金聖圭！\n\n11 月的週五、週六\nINSPIRIT 、市民又有約了！\n\n一起來應援團隊觀看\n\nhttps://x.com/sungkyuonair/status/2117957595113906241?a=Op7_wbtzcKXZNt9KLvQ&s=46","username":"inspirit0607","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@inspirit0607/post/DfUeXQ_k0Zs","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:38:03Z","media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-04T22:51:50.261390461Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:14.041113Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:14.041113Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_94980421cfa78e33","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
