{"id":"4023092741164746852","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"曹來直播啦\n\n說剛踢完足球正在吃麻辣香鍋跟鍋巴肉\n然後說演唱會結束兩天心情都很空虛\n因為三個月來都在努力準備演唱會，突然演唱會結束感覺心裡空空的，說看了推特發現自己最後的感想講的好像要隱退了一樣🤣🤣🤣\n\n說了為什麼在演唱會哭了，說自己好幾次在家裡看index_00演唱會版本的시네마都哭了🤣\n然後解釋自己哭有一點也是因為加了演技成分🤣\n（明明就是哭了 在那邊解釋）\n\n當然說在唱抒情歌的時候內心感情是爆發，眼淚也是快掉下來，但攝影機照到的瞬間就思考這要不加一點演技，所以就參雜了一點演技（所以才掉眼淚了？）\n\n然後說了為什麼沒唱Smashing Concrete和비행\n說是沒有適合放的地方所以就沒唱了～\n\n隨聽隨翻 不準請見諒","username":"seunseun_0805","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@seunseun_0805/post/DfU5Yhnk8hk","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:34:09Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-04T22:51:50.261318045Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:14.041113Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:14.041113Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_2bb43fc14fb7fef9","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4023098155197503582","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"To the girl standing 95% during the whole concert \nSection 132 - infront of row U - seat 28 \n\nThis is my view for the whole concert \nExcept when 5mins total when she’s tired she sit down to rest \n\nYou literally purchased a SEATED concert ticket \nSo act like it \nIf you enjoy standing so much you can always buy the standing tickets \n\nI asked her to sit down politely when the show just started, she had the audacity to reply me “ this is a concert , I will be standing the whole concert so you should","username":"janemsy","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@janemsy/post/DfU6nT1E5he","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:44:54Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:07.932615759Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:14.041113Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-04T22:52:14.041113Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_4d12d75adcab3f7c","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
